<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>News on UniTN Cybersecurity</title><link>https://CybersecurityUnitn.github.io/news/</link><description>Recent content in News on UniTN Cybersecurity</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 01 Sep 2023 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://CybersecurityUnitn.github.io/news/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>ESORICS 2023</title><link>https://CybersecurityUnitn.github.io/news/esorics-2023/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Sep 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://CybersecurityUnitn.github.io/news/esorics-2023/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;We will be at &lt;a href="https://esorics2023.org/"&gt;ESORICS 2023&lt;/a&gt; in The Hague between September 25–29, 2023 to present our latest research.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Paper accepted at WASP 2023</title><link>https://CybersecurityUnitn.github.io/news/nonce-nce-wasp-2023/</link><pubDate>Wed, 02 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://CybersecurityUnitn.github.io/news/nonce-nce-wasp-2023/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Our paper &lt;a href="https://CybersecurityUnitn.github.io/publication/the-nonce-nce-of-web-security-an-investigation-of-csp-nonces-reuse/"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Nonce-nce of Web Security: an Investigation of CSP Nonces Reuse&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; was accepted at the &lt;a href="https://wasp-workshop.github.io/"&gt;WASP workshop&lt;/a&gt; at &lt;a href="https://esorics2023.org/"&gt;ESORICS 2023&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Mind the CORS accepted at IEEE TPS 2023</title><link>https://CybersecurityUnitn.github.io/news/mind-the-cors-tps-2023/</link><pubDate>Tue, 01 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://CybersecurityUnitn.github.io/news/mind-the-cors-tps-2023/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Our paper &lt;strong&gt;Mind the CORS&lt;/strong&gt; was accepted at &lt;a href="https://www.sis.pitt.edu/lersais/conference/tps/2023/index.html"&gt;IEEE TPS 2023&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://CybersecurityUnitn.github.io/author/matteo-golinelli/"&gt;Matteo Golinelli&lt;/a&gt; will be at &lt;a href="https://www.sis.pitt.edu/lersais/conference/tps/2023/index.html"&gt;IEEE TPS 2023&lt;/a&gt; in Atlanta between November 1–3, 2023 to present &lt;a href="https://CybersecurityUnitn.github.io/publication/mind-the-cors/"&gt;Mind the CORS&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>